WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.975
Before changing dtypes or encoding categories
inspect the dataframe Head

00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:11.570
shows sample rows Info reports current technical
dtypes and non-null counts

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:18.162
Missingness counts reveal completeness issues
Unique-value counts can help identify

00:00:18.188 --> 00:00:23.690
categories or suspicious identifiers These commands
provide

00:00:23.703 --> 00:00:30.676
evidence They do not decide the analytical meaning
for us We

00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:35.308
combine the software output with our understanding
of what each variable represents
